---
title: Prayers for the Candidates (Confirmation)
type: prayer
citation: BCP 417
bulletin: full
---

[Rubric] *The Bishop then says to the congregation*
[Bishop] Let us now pray for *these persons* who have renewed *their* commitment to Christ.
[Rubric] *The petitions on pages 305-306 may be used. A period of silence follows.*
[Rubric] *Then the Bishop says*
[Bishop] Almighty God, we thank you that by the death and resurrection of your Son Jesus Christ you have overcome sin and brought us to yourself, and that by the sealing of your Holy Spirit you have bound us to your service. Renew in
    *these* your *servants* the covenant you have made with *them* at *their* Baptism. Send *them* forth in the power of that Spirit to perform the service you set before *them*; through Jesus Christ your Son our Lord, who lives and reigns with you and the Holy Spirit, one God, now and for ever.
[People] **Amen.**
